*> Test of 29a section 1, Fluids and fluid states (core/src/fluids-29a.cob; T0479): the five fluids, the legacy liquid block levels and ids, heights, camera height and the flow vector.
*> A case loads its inputs from a text of numbers (LOAD-IN fills WS-I as integers and WS-FX as doubles), calls the program
*> and shows the outputs WS-R(1..WS-N) joined by "/", one group per call; expected values come from the rules and tables of the section.
 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. TEST-FLUIDS-29A-1.
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 COPY TESTLIB.
 COPY INTERACT.
 01 WS-ISG.
    05 WS-I1 BINARY-LONG.
    05 WS-I2 BINARY-LONG.
    05 WS-I3 BINARY-LONG.
    05 WS-I4 BINARY-LONG.
    05 WS-I5 BINARY-LONG.
    05 WS-I6 BINARY-LONG.
    05 WS-I7 BINARY-LONG.
    05 WS-I8 BINARY-LONG.
    05 WS-I9 BINARY-LONG.
    05 WS-I10 BINARY-LONG.
    05 WS-I11 BINARY-LONG.
    05 WS-I12 BINARY-LONG.
    05 WS-I13 BINARY-LONG.
    05 WS-I14 BINARY-LONG.
    05 WS-I15 BINARY-LONG.
    05 WS-I16 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-IST REDEFINES WS-ISG.
    05 WS-I BINARY-LONG OCCURS 16 TIMES.
 01 WS-FXSG.
    05 WS-FX1 FLOAT-LONG.
    05 WS-FX2 FLOAT-LONG.
    05 WS-FX3 FLOAT-LONG.
    05 WS-FX4 FLOAT-LONG.
    05 WS-FX5 FLOAT-LONG.
    05 WS-FX6 FLOAT-LONG.
    05 WS-FX7 FLOAT-LONG.
    05 WS-FX8 FLOAT-LONG.
    05 WS-FX9 FLOAT-LONG.
    05 WS-FX10 FLOAT-LONG.
    05 WS-FX11 FLOAT-LONG.
    05 WS-FX12 FLOAT-LONG.
    05 WS-FX13 FLOAT-LONG.
    05 WS-FX14 FLOAT-LONG.
    05 WS-FX15 FLOAT-LONG.
    05 WS-FX16 FLOAT-LONG.
 01 WS-FXST REDEFINES WS-FXSG.
    05 WS-FX FLOAT-LONG OCCURS 16 TIMES.
 01 WS-RSG.
    05 WS-R1 BINARY-LONG.
    05 WS-R2 BINARY-LONG.
    05 WS-R3 BINARY-LONG.
    05 WS-R4 BINARY-LONG.
    05 WS-R5 BINARY-LONG.
    05 WS-R6 BINARY-LONG.
    05 WS-R7 BINARY-LONG.
    05 WS-R8 BINARY-LONG.
    05 WS-R9 BINARY-LONG.
    05 WS-R10 BINARY-LONG.
    05 WS-R11 BINARY-LONG.
    05 WS-R12 BINARY-LONG.
    05 WS-R13 BINARY-LONG.
    05 WS-R14 BINARY-LONG.
    05 WS-R15 BINARY-LONG.
    05 WS-R16 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-RST REDEFINES WS-RSG.
    05 WS-R BINARY-LONG OCCURS 16 TIMES.
 01 WS-RFSG.
    05 WS-RF1 FLOAT-LONG.
    05 WS-RF2 FLOAT-LONG.
    05 WS-RF3 FLOAT-LONG.
    05 WS-RF4 FLOAT-LONG.
    05 WS-RF5 FLOAT-LONG.
    05 WS-RF6 FLOAT-LONG.
    05 WS-RF7 FLOAT-LONG.
    05 WS-RF8 FLOAT-LONG.
 01 WS-RFST REDEFINES WS-RFSG.
    05 WS-RF FLOAT-LONG OCCURS 8 TIMES.
 01 WS-IN                  PIC X(160).
 01 WS-TOK                 PIC X(24).
 01 WS-P                   BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-K                   BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-N                   BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-J                   BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-PTR                 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-SHOW                PIC -(9)9.
 01 WS-TEXTS.
    05 WS-T1               PIC X(96).
    05 WS-T2               PIC X(96).
 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
     MOVE "T" TO TL-MODE
     MOVE "acceptance US12 29a§1 Fluids and fluid states: isSame accepts water with flowing water and lava with flowing lava only" TO TL-CASE
     PERFORM BEGIN-CASE
     MOVE "1 2" TO WS-IN
     PERFORM LOAD-IN
     CALL "FL-SAME" USING WS-I1 WS-I2 WS-R1
     MOVE 1 TO WS-N
     PERFORM ADD-N
     MOVE "2 1" TO WS-IN
     PERFORM LOAD-IN
     CALL "FL-SAME" USING WS-I1 WS-I2 WS-R1
     MOVE 1 TO WS-N
     PERFORM ADD-N
     MOVE "3 4" TO WS-IN
     PERFORM LOAD-IN
     CALL "FL-SAME" USING WS-I1 WS-I2 WS-R1
     MOVE 1 TO WS-N
     PERFORM ADD-N
     MOVE "1 3" TO WS-IN
     PERFORM LOAD-IN
     CALL "FL-SAME" USING WS-I1 WS-I2 WS-R1
     MOVE 1 TO WS-N
     PERFORM ADD-N
     MOVE "0 0" TO WS-IN
     PERFORM LOAD-IN
     CALL "FL-SAME" USING WS-I1 WS-I2 WS-R1
     MOVE 1 TO WS-N
     PERFORM ADD-N
     MOVE "2 2" TO WS-IN
     PERFORM LOAD-IN
     CALL "FL-SAME" USING WS-I1 WS-I2 WS-R1
     MOVE 1 TO WS-N
     PERFORM ADD-N
     MOVE "0 1" TO WS-IN
     PERFORM LOAD-IN
     CALL "FL-SAME" USING WS-I1 WS-I2 WS-R1
     MOVE 1 TO WS-N
     PERFORM ADD-N
     MOVE "1 1 1 0 0 1 0" TO TL-EXPECTED
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     MOVE "acceptance US12 29a§1 Fluids and fluid states: block level to fluid state: index min(level, 8); 0 source, 1 to 7 flowing amount 8 - index, 8 and above falling amount 8" TO TL-CASE
     PERFORM BEGIN-CASE
     MOVE "1 0" TO WS-IN
     PERFORM LOAD-IN
     CALL "FL-FROM-LEVEL" USING WS-I1 WS-I2 WS-R1 WS-R2 WS-R3
     MOVE 3 TO WS-N
     PERFORM ADD-N
     MOVE "1 1" TO WS-IN
     PERFORM LOAD-IN
     CALL "FL-FROM-LEVEL" USING WS-I1 WS-I2 WS-R1 WS-R2 WS-R3
     MOVE 3 TO WS-N
     PERFORM ADD-N
     MOVE "1 7" TO WS-IN
     PERFORM LOAD-IN
     CALL "FL-FROM-LEVEL" USING WS-I1 WS-I2 WS-R1 WS-R2 WS-R3
     MOVE 3 TO WS-N
     PERFORM ADD-N
     MOVE "1 8" TO WS-IN
     PERFORM LOAD-IN
     CALL "FL-FROM-LEVEL" USING WS-I1 WS-I2 WS-R1 WS-R2 WS-R3
     MOVE 3 TO WS-N
     PERFORM ADD-N
     MOVE "1 15" TO WS-IN
     PERFORM LOAD-IN
     CALL "FL-FROM-LEVEL" USING WS-I1 WS-I2 WS-R1 WS-R2 WS-R3
     MOVE 3 TO WS-N
     PERFORM ADD-N
     MOVE "2 0" TO WS-IN
     PERFORM LOAD-IN
     CALL "FL-FROM-LEVEL" USING WS-I1 WS-I2 WS-R1 WS-R2 WS-R3
     MOVE 3 TO WS-N
     PERFORM ADD-N
     MOVE "2 3" TO WS-IN
     PERFORM LOAD-IN
     CALL "FL-FROM-LEVEL" USING WS-I1 WS-I2 WS-R1 WS-R2 WS-R3
     MOVE 3 TO WS-N
     PERFORM ADD-N
     MOVE "2/8/0 1/7/0 1/1/0 1/8/1 1/8/1 4/8/0 3/5/0" TO TL-EXPECTED
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     MOVE "acceptance US12 29a§1 Fluids and fluid states: fluid state to legacy level: source 0, flowing (8 - amount) + 8 when falling, empty is air" TO TL-CASE
     PERFORM BEGIN-CASE
     MOVE "2 8 0" TO WS-IN
     PERFORM LOAD-IN
     CALL "FL-LEGACY" USING WS-I1 WS-I2 WS-I3 WS-R1
     MOVE 1 TO WS-N
     PERFORM ADD-N
     MOVE "1 7 0" TO WS-IN
     PERFORM LOAD-IN
     CALL "FL-LEGACY" USING WS-I1 WS-I2 WS-I3 WS-R1
     MOVE 1 TO WS-N
     PERFORM ADD-N
     MOVE "1 1 0" TO WS-IN
     PERFORM LOAD-IN
     CALL "FL-LEGACY" USING WS-I1 WS-I2 WS-I3 WS-R1
     MOVE 1 TO WS-N
     PERFORM ADD-N
     MOVE "1 8 1" TO WS-IN
     PERFORM LOAD-IN
     CALL "FL-LEGACY" USING WS-I1 WS-I2 WS-I3 WS-R1
     MOVE 1 TO WS-N
     PERFORM ADD-N
     MOVE "0 0 0" TO WS-IN
     PERFORM LOAD-IN
     CALL "FL-LEGACY" USING WS-I1 WS-I2 WS-I3 WS-R1
     MOVE 1 TO WS-N
     PERFORM ADD-N
     MOVE "3 5 0" TO WS-IN
     PERFORM LOAD-IN
     CALL "FL-LEGACY" USING WS-I1 WS-I2 WS-I3 WS-R1
     MOVE 1 TO WS-N
     PERFORM ADD-N
     MOVE "1 5 1" TO WS-IN
     PERFORM LOAD-IN
     CALL "FL-LEGACY" USING WS-I1 WS-I2 WS-I3 WS-R1
     MOVE 1 TO WS-N
     PERFORM ADD-N
     MOVE "0 1 7 8 -1 3 11" TO TL-EXPECTED
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     MOVE "acceptance US12 29a§1 Fluids and fluid states: block state ids: water 89 + level, lava 105 + level (levels 0 to 15)" TO TL-CASE
     PERFORM BEGIN-CASE
     MOVE "1 0" TO WS-IN
     PERFORM LOAD-IN
     CALL "FL-BLOCK-ID" USING WS-I1 WS-I2 WS-R1
     MOVE 1 TO WS-N
     PERFORM ADD-N
     MOVE "1 8" TO WS-IN
     PERFORM LOAD-IN
     CALL "FL-BLOCK-ID" USING WS-I1 WS-I2 WS-R1
     MOVE 1 TO WS-N
     PERFORM ADD-N
     MOVE "1 15" TO WS-IN
     PERFORM LOAD-IN
     CALL "FL-BLOCK-ID" USING WS-I1 WS-I2 WS-R1
     MOVE 1 TO WS-N
     PERFORM ADD-N
     MOVE "2 0" TO WS-IN
     PERFORM LOAD-IN
     CALL "FL-BLOCK-ID" USING WS-I1 WS-I2 WS-R1
     MOVE 1 TO WS-N
     PERFORM ADD-N
     MOVE "2 15" TO WS-IN
     PERFORM LOAD-IN
     CALL "FL-BLOCK-ID" USING WS-I1 WS-I2 WS-R1
     MOVE 1 TO WS-N
     PERFORM ADD-N
     MOVE "89 97 104 105 120" TO TL-EXPECTED
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     MOVE "acceptance US12 29a§1 Fluids and fluid states: own height is amount / 9 in single precision (source 0.8888889, empty 0)" TO TL-CASE
     PERFORM BEGIN-CASE
     MOVE "8" TO WS-IN
     PERFORM LOAD-IN
     CALL "FL-OWN-HEIGHT" USING WS-I1 WS-RF1
     COMPUTE WS-R1 ROUNDED = WS-RF1 * 1000000
     MOVE 1 TO WS-N
     PERFORM ADD-N
     MOVE "1" TO WS-IN
     PERFORM LOAD-IN
     CALL "FL-OWN-HEIGHT" USING WS-I1 WS-RF1
     COMPUTE WS-R1 ROUNDED = WS-RF1 * 1000000
     MOVE 1 TO WS-N
     PERFORM ADD-N
     MOVE "0" TO WS-IN
     PERFORM LOAD-IN
     CALL "FL-OWN-HEIGHT" USING WS-I1 WS-RF1
     COMPUTE WS-R1 ROUNDED = WS-RF1 * 1000000
     MOVE 1 TO WS-N
     PERFORM ADD-N
     MOVE "4" TO WS-IN
     PERFORM LOAD-IN
     CALL "FL-OWN-HEIGHT" USING WS-I1 WS-RF1
     COMPUTE WS-R1 ROUNDED = WS-RF1 * 1000000
     MOVE 1 TO WS-N
     PERFORM ADD-N
     MOVE "888889 111111 0 444444" TO TL-EXPECTED
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     MOVE "acceptance US12 29a§1 Fluids and fluid states: height is 1.0 when the block above holds the same fluid, else the own height" TO TL-CASE
     PERFORM BEGIN-CASE
     MOVE "8 1" TO WS-IN
     PERFORM LOAD-IN
     CALL "FL-HEIGHT" USING WS-I1 WS-I2 WS-RF1
     COMPUTE WS-R1 ROUNDED = WS-RF1 * 1000000
     MOVE 1 TO WS-N
     PERFORM ADD-N
     MOVE "8 0" TO WS-IN
     PERFORM LOAD-IN
     CALL "FL-HEIGHT" USING WS-I1 WS-I2 WS-RF1
     COMPUTE WS-R1 ROUNDED = WS-RF1 * 1000000
     MOVE 1 TO WS-N
     PERFORM ADD-N
     MOVE "4 0" TO WS-IN
     PERFORM LOAD-IN
     CALL "FL-HEIGHT" USING WS-I1 WS-I2 WS-RF1
     COMPUTE WS-R1 ROUNDED = WS-RF1 * 1000000
     MOVE 1 TO WS-N
     PERFORM ADD-N
     MOVE "0 0" TO WS-IN
     PERFORM LOAD-IN
     CALL "FL-HEIGHT" USING WS-I1 WS-I2 WS-RF1
     COMPUTE WS-R1 ROUNDED = WS-RF1 * 1000000
     MOVE 1 TO WS-N
     PERFORM ADD-N
     MOVE "1000000 888889 444444 0" TO TL-EXPECTED
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     MOVE "acceptance US12 29a§1 Fluids and fluid states: camera height is 1.0 for a source under a sturdy DOWN face, else the height" TO TL-CASE
     PERFORM BEGIN-CASE
     MOVE "1 1 8 0" TO WS-IN
     PERFORM LOAD-IN
     CALL "FL-CAMERA" USING WS-I1 WS-I2 WS-I3 WS-I4 WS-RF1
     COMPUTE WS-R1 ROUNDED = WS-RF1 * 1000000
     MOVE 1 TO WS-N
     PERFORM ADD-N
     MOVE "1 0 8 0" TO WS-IN
     PERFORM LOAD-IN
     CALL "FL-CAMERA" USING WS-I1 WS-I2 WS-I3 WS-I4 WS-RF1
     COMPUTE WS-R1 ROUNDED = WS-RF1 * 1000000
     MOVE 1 TO WS-N
     PERFORM ADD-N
     MOVE "0 1 5 0" TO WS-IN
     PERFORM LOAD-IN
     CALL "FL-CAMERA" USING WS-I1 WS-I2 WS-I3 WS-I4 WS-RF1
     COMPUTE WS-R1 ROUNDED = WS-RF1 * 1000000
     MOVE 1 TO WS-N
     PERFORM ADD-N
     MOVE "0 1 5 1" TO WS-IN
     PERFORM LOAD-IN
     CALL "FL-CAMERA" USING WS-I1 WS-I2 WS-I3 WS-I4 WS-RF1
     COMPUTE WS-R1 ROUNDED = WS-RF1 * 1000000
     MOVE 1 TO WS-N
     PERFORM ADD-N
     MOVE "1000000 888889 555556 1000000" TO TL-EXPECTED
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     MOVE "acceptance US12 29a§1 Fluids and fluid states: flow delta of one direction: the own height difference to a fluid neighbour; for an empty neighbour that does not block flow, the drop to the fluid" TO TL-CASE
     PERFORM BEGIN-CASE
     MOVE "1 0.55555558 0 0 0.00000000 0.88888890" TO WS-IN
     PERFORM LOAD-IN
     CALL "FL-FLOW-DELTA" USING WS-I1 WS-FX2 WS-I3 WS-I4 WS-FX5 WS-FX6 WS-RF1
     COMPUTE WS-R1 ROUNDED = WS-RF1 * 1000000
     MOVE 1 TO WS-N
     PERFORM ADD-N
     MOVE "1 0.00000000 0 1 0.55555558 0.88888890" TO WS-IN
     PERFORM LOAD-IN
     CALL "FL-FLOW-DELTA" USING WS-I1 WS-FX2 WS-I3 WS-I4 WS-FX5 WS-FX6 WS-RF1
     COMPUTE WS-R1 ROUNDED = WS-RF1 * 1000000
     MOVE 1 TO WS-N
     PERFORM ADD-N
     MOVE "1 0.00000000 1 1 0.55555558 0.88888890" TO WS-IN
     PERFORM LOAD-IN
     CALL "FL-FLOW-DELTA" USING WS-I1 WS-FX2 WS-I3 WS-I4 WS-FX5 WS-FX6 WS-RF1
     COMPUTE WS-R1 ROUNDED = WS-RF1 * 1000000
     MOVE 1 TO WS-N
     PERFORM ADD-N
     MOVE "1 0.00000000 0 1 0.00000000 0.88888890" TO WS-IN
     PERFORM LOAD-IN
     CALL "FL-FLOW-DELTA" USING WS-I1 WS-FX2 WS-I3 WS-I4 WS-FX5 WS-FX6 WS-RF1
     COMPUTE WS-R1 ROUNDED = WS-RF1 * 1000000
     MOVE 1 TO WS-N
     PERFORM ADD-N
     MOVE "0 0.55555558 0 0 0.00000000 0.88888890" TO WS-IN
     PERFORM LOAD-IN
     CALL "FL-FLOW-DELTA" USING WS-I1 WS-FX2 WS-I3 WS-I4 WS-FX5 WS-FX6 WS-RF1
     COMPUTE WS-R1 ROUNDED = WS-RF1 * 1000000
     MOVE 1 TO WS-N
     PERFORM ADD-N
     MOVE "1 0.00000000 0 0 0.55555558 0.88888890" TO WS-IN
     PERFORM LOAD-IN
     CALL "FL-FLOW-DELTA" USING WS-I1 WS-FX2 WS-I3 WS-I4 WS-FX5 WS-FX6 WS-RF1
     COMPUTE WS-R1 ROUNDED = WS-RF1 * 1000000
     MOVE 1 TO WS-N
     PERFORM ADD-N
     MOVE "333333 1222222 0 0 0 0" TO TL-EXPECTED
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     MOVE "acceptance US12 29a§1 Fluids and fluid states: flow vector: the normalised horizontal sum; a falling column next to a solid face adds (0, -6, 0) before normalising; zero stays zero" TO TL-CASE
     PERFORM BEGIN-CASE
     MOVE "3 4 0 0" TO WS-IN
     PERFORM LOAD-IN
     CALL "FL-FLOW" USING WS-FX1 WS-FX2 WS-I3 WS-I4 WS-RF1 WS-RF2 WS-RF3
     COMPUTE WS-R1 ROUNDED = WS-RF1 * 1000
     COMPUTE WS-R2 ROUNDED = WS-RF2 * 1000
     COMPUTE WS-R3 ROUNDED = WS-RF3 * 1000
     MOVE 3 TO WS-N
     PERFORM ADD-N
     MOVE "0 0 0 0" TO WS-IN
     PERFORM LOAD-IN
     CALL "FL-FLOW" USING WS-FX1 WS-FX2 WS-I3 WS-I4 WS-RF1 WS-RF2 WS-RF3
     COMPUTE WS-R1 ROUNDED = WS-RF1 * 1000
     COMPUTE WS-R2 ROUNDED = WS-RF2 * 1000
     COMPUTE WS-R3 ROUNDED = WS-RF3 * 1000
     MOVE 3 TO WS-N
     PERFORM ADD-N
     MOVE "3 4 1 1" TO WS-IN
     PERFORM LOAD-IN
     CALL "FL-FLOW" USING WS-FX1 WS-FX2 WS-I3 WS-I4 WS-RF1 WS-RF2 WS-RF3
     COMPUTE WS-R1 ROUNDED = WS-RF1 * 1000
     COMPUTE WS-R2 ROUNDED = WS-RF2 * 1000
     COMPUTE WS-R3 ROUNDED = WS-RF3 * 1000
     MOVE 3 TO WS-N
     PERFORM ADD-N
     MOVE "3 4 1 0" TO WS-IN
     PERFORM LOAD-IN
     CALL "FL-FLOW" USING WS-FX1 WS-FX2 WS-I3 WS-I4 WS-RF1 WS-RF2 WS-RF3
     COMPUTE WS-R1 ROUNDED = WS-RF1 * 1000
     COMPUTE WS-R2 ROUNDED = WS-RF2 * 1000
     COMPUTE WS-R3 ROUNDED = WS-RF3 * 1000
     MOVE 3 TO WS-N
     PERFORM ADD-N
     MOVE "-1 0 0 0" TO WS-IN
     PERFORM LOAD-IN
     CALL "FL-FLOW" USING WS-FX1 WS-FX2 WS-I3 WS-I4 WS-RF1 WS-RF2 WS-RF3
     COMPUTE WS-R1 ROUNDED = WS-RF1 * 1000
     COMPUTE WS-R2 ROUNDED = WS-RF2 * 1000
     COMPUTE WS-R3 ROUNDED = WS-RF3 * 1000
     MOVE 3 TO WS-N
     PERFORM ADD-N
     MOVE "0 0 1 1" TO WS-IN
     PERFORM LOAD-IN
     CALL "FL-FLOW" USING WS-FX1 WS-FX2 WS-I3 WS-I4 WS-RF1 WS-RF2 WS-RF3
     COMPUTE WS-R1 ROUNDED = WS-RF1 * 1000
     COMPUTE WS-R2 ROUNDED = WS-RF2 * 1000
     COMPUTE WS-R3 ROUNDED = WS-RF3 * 1000
     MOVE 3 TO WS-N
     PERFORM ADD-N
     MOVE "600/0/800 0/0/0 99/-986/132 600/0/800 -1000/0/0 0/-1000/0" TO TL-EXPECTED
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     MOVE "acceptance US12 29a§1 Fluids and fluid states: isSolidFace: false for the same fluid, true for UP, false for ice, else the sturdy face" TO TL-CASE
     PERFORM BEGIN-CASE
     MOVE "1 0 0 1" TO WS-IN
     PERFORM LOAD-IN
     CALL "FL-SOLID-FACE" USING WS-I1 WS-I2 WS-I3 WS-I4 WS-R1
     MOVE 1 TO WS-N
     PERFORM ADD-N
     MOVE "0 1 0 0" TO WS-IN
     PERFORM LOAD-IN
     CALL "FL-SOLID-FACE" USING WS-I1 WS-I2 WS-I3 WS-I4 WS-R1
     MOVE 1 TO WS-N
     PERFORM ADD-N
     MOVE "0 0 1 1" TO WS-IN
     PERFORM LOAD-IN
     CALL "FL-SOLID-FACE" USING WS-I1 WS-I2 WS-I3 WS-I4 WS-R1
     MOVE 1 TO WS-N
     PERFORM ADD-N
     MOVE "0 0 0 1" TO WS-IN
     PERFORM LOAD-IN
     CALL "FL-SOLID-FACE" USING WS-I1 WS-I2 WS-I3 WS-I4 WS-R1
     MOVE 1 TO WS-N
     PERFORM ADD-N
     MOVE "0 0 0 0" TO WS-IN
     PERFORM LOAD-IN
     CALL "FL-SOLID-FACE" USING WS-I1 WS-I2 WS-I3 WS-I4 WS-R1
     MOVE 1 TO WS-N
     PERFORM ADD-N
     MOVE "0 1 0 1 0" TO TL-EXPECTED
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     STOP RUN.

 BEGIN-CASE.
     MOVE SPACES TO TL-OBSERVED
     MOVE 1 TO WS-PTR
     .

 LOAD-IN.
     MOVE 1 TO WS-P
     PERFORM VARYING WS-K FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-K > 16
         MOVE SPACES TO WS-TOK
         IF WS-P <= 160
             UNSTRING WS-IN DELIMITED BY ALL SPACE INTO WS-TOK WITH POINTER WS-P
         END-IF
         COMPUTE WS-FX(WS-K) = FUNCTION NUMVAL(WS-TOK)
         COMPUTE WS-I(WS-K) = FUNCTION NUMVAL(WS-TOK)
     END-PERFORM
     .

 ADD-N.
     PERFORM VARYING WS-J FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-J > WS-N
         MOVE WS-R(WS-J) TO WS-SHOW
         IF WS-J > 1
             STRING "/" DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO TL-OBSERVED WITH POINTER WS-PTR
         END-IF
         STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-SHOW) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO TL-OBSERVED WITH POINTER WS-PTR
     END-PERFORM
     STRING " " DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO TL-OBSERVED WITH POINTER WS-PTR
     .

 ADD-TEXT.
     STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-T1) "|" FUNCTION TRIM(WS-T2) " " DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO TL-OBSERVED WITH POINTER WS-PTR
     .
 END PROGRAM TEST-FLUIDS-29A-1.
